sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports DER Control
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Report DER alarm
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyDERAlarmRequest (controlType = LVMustTrip, gridEventFault = UnderVoltage, alarmEnded = false, timestamp = <Current DateTime>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyDERAlarmResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System waits 5 seconds

    Note over CS,CSMS: Clear DER alarm
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyDERAlarmRequest (controlType = LVMustTrip, gridEventFault = UnderVoltage, alarmEnded = true, timestamp = <Current DateTime>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyDERAlarmResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Tool validations: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
